2 tokens for each benchmark. Benchmark (Metric) DeepSeek DeepSeek Qwen2.5 LLaMA-3.1 Claude-3.5- GPT-4o DeepSeek V2-0506 V2.5-0905 72B-Inst. 405B-Inst."
