loration in high-level abstraction, fine-grained credit assignment, and multi-turn agent-environment interactions may 12 Does Reinforcement Learning Really Incentivize Reasoning Capacity in LLMs Beyond the Base Model? alleviate this problem."
doc27-s08-c02,doc27-s08,doc27,2,"We hope the community will continue developing methods along these dimensions to unlock the potential of reinforcement learning to discover genuinely novel reasoning strategies. Despite our best efforts, this study has several limitations. Although we have attempted to evaluate as many strong, publicly available pure-RLVR models as possible, our analysis is constrained by the fact that many of the most capable models and training pipelines remain proprietary. Moreover, RL for LLM is rapidly evolving, and emerging techniques may mitigate some of the limitations identified here. Consequently, our conclusions should be interpreted with awareness of these practical constraints.",,"[0.001547, -0.000399, -0.020061, 0.014579, -0.035769, 0.054724, -0.012693, 0.021143, -0.021285, 0.00664, 0.031235, -0.030534, 0.024298, 0.014825, -0.045732, -0.077083, -0.007362, 0.068231, -0.030822, 0.01926, 0.032422, 0.073644, -0.017933, -0.053211, 0.06733, 0.055345, 0.056913, -0.05056, 0.015279, 0.033854, 0.029375, -0.015443, 0.002912, 0.028067, 0.00919, 0.005359, -0.020392, -0.000344, -0.00526, -0.033314, -0.041112, 0.016354, -0.054094, 0.018923, -0.019348, -0.027389, -0.02428, -0.048556, -0.007804, 0.008314, -0.019854, -0.005122, -0.033081, -0.016873, 0.015757, 0.041341, 0.049639, 0.012018, 0.050715, -0.027747, 0.002779, 0.019218, -0.065351, 0.030545, 0.013402, -0.018741, 0.052479, 0.047747, 0.00137, 0.105236, -0.006296, -0.036822, -0.008476, -0.040434, 0.147477, 0.068076, -0.014947, 0.003534, -0.038699, 0.003487, -0.007882, 0.028864, 0.005082, -0.056925, 0.025219, 0.047274, -0.110024, 0.007951, 0.023721, 0.062517, 0.025397, 0.003284, -0.055482, 0.006317, 0.027352, -0.04009, -0.033999, -0.091157, -0.006683, -0.031616, 0.000489, 0.004836, 0.049776, 0.06689, 0.028374, 0.055784, -0.022299, 0.00574, 0.055421, -0.027783, 0.015188, -0.018864, -0.036604, -0.008669, -0.068246, -0.007233, -0.083315, 0.059579, -0.041044, 0.003168, 0.029656, 0.003728, 0.054891, -0.00